    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Superb Family Home in a Peaceful Countryside Setting:\n\nStunning bungalow in pristine condition throughout, offering exceptional space, quality finishes and beautifully landscaped gardens, all within easy reach of Ballaghaderreen town.\n\nWe are delighted to present this exceptional, beautifully maintained four-bedroom bungalow, ideally situated at Bohalas, Ballaghaderreen, Co. Roscommon. \nCombining the tranquillity of countryside living with the convenience of being just approximately 4km from Ballaghaderreen town and its many amenities, this outstanding property offers an ideal setting for modern family life.\n\nExtending to an impressive C229.45 m² (C2,470 sq. ft.), this superb home has been finished to an exceptionally high standard, showcasing quality craftsmanship, elegant interiors and thoughtful design throughout. \n\nPresented in pristine condition, the property offers generous and versatile living accommodation, making it a rare opportunity in today's market.\n\nThe welcoming entrance hall, complete with attractive floor tiling, leads to a series of beautifully appointed reception rooms, including:\nLiving Room: A warm and inviting space featuring beautiful solid oak flooring.\nSitting Room: An elegant additional reception room, enhanced by solid oak flooring and an impressive Italian limestone fireplace.\nKitchen/Diner: A fully fitted and tiled kitchen featuring a quality solid oak kitchen with quartz worktops, providing a stylish and practical space for everyday family living.\nSeparate Dining Room: A superb space for entertaining, with patio doors opening onto a covered patio area, ideal for indoor-outdoor living.\nUtility Room: A large, fully fitted utility room offering excellent additional storage and functionality.\nGuest WC: Conveniently located off the main accommodation.\n\nThe property boasts four generously proportioned double bedrooms, each thoughtfully designed to provide comfort and practicality and benefit from fitted sliding wardrobes.\n\nThe master bedroom enjoys the added luxury of a beautifully tiled en-suite, while the tastefully tiled family bathroom is a particularly attractive feature, incorporating a stunning freestanding cast-iron bath and a separate shower unit.\n\nSet on an impressive site extending to approximately 0.77 acres, the property is surrounded by beautifully landscaped gardens that provide a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity.\n\nThe meticulously maintained grounds feature manicured lawns, mature trees and attractive hedging, creating a delightful outdoor environment for relaxation, family activities and garden enthusiasts alike.\n\nFurther enhancing the property is a large tarmac driveway providing ample off-street parking, complemented by an attractive feature stone wall and impressive electric entrance gates, offering both privacy and security.\n\nA purpose-built garage to the side of the property provides excellent additional storage, while the covered patio area offers an ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nExceptional Features\n•Impressive accommodation extending to approximately 229.45 m²\n•Four spacious double bedrooms\n•Master bedroom with tiled en-suite\n•Elegant living room and separate sitting room\n•Italian limestone fireplace\n•Quality solid oak kitchen with quartz worktops\n•Separate dining room with patio doors\n•Large fully fitted utility room\n•Tastefully tiled family bathroom with freestanding cast-iron bath and separate shower\n•Sliding wardrobes fitted in all bedrooms\n•Solid oak flooring throughout\n•High-quality Palladio composite front and rear doors\n•Solar thermal panels\n•Cast-iron outdoor lighting\n•Cast-iron post box integrated into entrance gate pier\n•Electric entrance gates\n•Beautifully landscaped 0.77-acre site\n•Large tarmac driveway with ample parking\n•Purpose-built garage\n•Covered patio area\n\nRarely does a property of this size and quality come on the For Sale Market.\nGuaranteed not to disappoint, viewing of this stunning family home is highly recommended and welcomed..\n\n\n"
      },
